# The quiver behind the right hip (graphics/mesh/quiver, docs/manual-aim.md, research.md of the report): 60 deg from
# the right side toward the back, nearly rigid (its turn halfway between the pelvis and SPINE1, a stiff spring,
# it gives way to the thigh). The hero and an npc bowman in five armours: standing with the bow, walking (S_WALKL,
# the militia's and the relaxed gait) and sneaking with the bow on the back, running with the bow (S_BOWRUNL), the
# aim and the shot; a two-hander on the back with the bow; 0, 1, 5, 20, 50 arrows. From in front on the right,
# the right side and behind on the right. slowmo 2: a row of metrics.csv is 1/60 s of the game: qv_armor, qv_leg,
# qv_arm (cm the armour, the legs, an arm go into the quiver), qv_bow, qv_2h (the bow and the two-hander on the
# back), qv_blade (an arrow out of the wall), qv_swing/back/outward (deg of the give), qv_twist (deg against
# SPINE1), qv_mx..qv_mz (the mouth in the pelvis bone's frame), qv_us (the step's cost). A clip to 60 fps in real
# time: ffmpeg -i x.mp4 -vf setpts=0.5*PTS -r 60 x60.mp4. The quiver's body: OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT with ITRW_QUIVER
# (reports/content/2026-11-quiver)
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
overlay off
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_091   # flat open ground
face -106                         # a rock behind, open in front
wait 500
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
arrows player 20
insert Sheep
wait 300
pin SHEEP 1200 0 0
aimat SHEEP body
cam look 95
slowmo 2
tap bow
wait 1500

